  "bio": "Frida Ghiozzi is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Turin, Italy, known for her mastery in sketch and dotwork styles. Clients appreciate her attention to detail and the clean, precise lines that bring her artwork to life on the skin. Her professionalism shines through in every piece, making her a sought-after tattooist for those in search of exceptional artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Turin, Piedmont, Italy\n\nTatuaggi ispirati al mondo dell'Occulto\nTorino, Italia | Info:+39 3755719375\n@creaturine_magiche \nGalleria Quadri: @frida_ghiozzi\nStudio: @imago_amens",
